        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Study Notes</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n            line-height: 1.8;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 20px 30px;\n            background-color: #fffff8;\n            background-image: \n                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),\n                linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);\n            background-size: 20px 20px;\n            color: #222;\n        }\n        .container {\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n        .handwritten-red {\n            color: #d84555;\n            font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"STKaiti\", cursive, serif;\n        }\n        .handwritten-blue {\n            color: #4a90e2;\n            font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"STKaiti\", cursive, serif;\n        }\n        .handwritten-purple {\n            color: #a453c5;\n            font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"STKaiti\", cursive, serif;\n        }\n        .circle-red {\n            border: 1px solid #d84555;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            padding: 2px;\n            margin: 0 1px;\n            display: inline-block;\n            line-height: 1;\n        }\n        .circle-red-large {\n            border: 1px solid #d84555;\n            border-radius: 40%;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin: 0 1px;\n            display: inline-block;\n            line-height: 1;\n        }\n        .bg-red-pill {\n            background-color: #ff9e9e;\n            color: #000;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 0px 8px;\n            display: inline-block;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n        .hl-blue {\n            background-color: #9cdbfa;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            padding: 0 2px;\n        }\n        .hl-purple {\n            background-color: #dcb3f8;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            padding: 0 2px;\n        }\n        .align-right-block {\n            display: block;\n            text-align: right;\n            margin-right: 25%;\n            margin-top: -5px;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n        .watermark {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 25%;\n            left: 50%;\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-10deg);\n            font-size: 48px;\n            color: rgba(100, 180, 220, 0.3);\n            font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"STKaiti\", cursive, serif;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            white-space: nowrap;\n            z-index: 0;\n        }\n        p {\n            margin: 8px 0;\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        .block-title {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            font-size: 1.05em;\n            margin-top: 25px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <!-- Watermark -->\n        <div class=\"watermark\">@小红书：起风了的风景</div>\n\n        <!-- Block 1 -->\n        <p class=\"block-title\" style=\"margin-top: 0;\">葛雷制 <span class=\"handwritten-red\">(没考过) 口诀：捡内衣 (<span class=\"circle-red-large\">简介</span>、<span class=\"circle-red-large\">内容</span>、<span class=\"circle-red-large\">意义</span>)</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"bg-red-pill\">简介</span>: 葛雷制又称“双校制”、“二部制”。是美国教育家沃特在葛雷市所推行的一种教学制度。</p>\n        <span class=\"handwritten-blue align-right-block\">&lt;学校分为“工商教立体”&gt;</span>\n        <p><span class=\"bg-red-pill\">内容</span>: 以杜威的教育思想为理论基础，把学校分为四个部分：<span class=\"hl-blue\">工厂和商店</span>、<span class=\"hl-blue\">教室</span>、<span class=\"hl-blue\">礼堂</span>、<span class=\"hl-blue\">体育运动场</span>；课程也分为四个方面：<span class=\"hl-purple\">家政和工艺</span>、<span class=\"hl-purple\">团体活动</span>、<span class=\"hl-purple\">体育游戏</span>、<span class=\"hl-purple\">学术</span>。</p>\n        <p>为了减少经费，将全校学生一分为二，一部分在教室上课，一部分在其他场所活动，上下午对调。</p>\n        <span class=\"handwritten-blue align-right-block\">&lt;课程分为“加工团体学”&gt;</span>\n        <p><span class=\"bg-red-pill\">意义</span>: 葛雷制是美国进步主义教育运动中最卓越的例子，既有利于保持儿童的兴趣，也有着经济高效的管理方式</p>\n\n        <!-- Block 2 -->\n        <p class=\"block-title\">昆西教学法 <span class=\"handwritten-red\">(考过简答) 口诀：含泪评价 (<span class=\"circle-red\">含</span>义、<span class=\"circle-red\">内</span>容、<span class=\"circle-red\">评</span><span class=\"circle-red\">价</span>)</span></p>\n        <p>一、<span class=\"bg-red-pill\">含义</span>: 昆西教学法由美国进步主义教育家帕克创办的一种教学方法。</p>\n        <p>二、<span class=\"bg-red-pill\">内容</span>: <span class=\"handwritten-blue\">(儿童中心重学校，学实联系培创造)</span></p>\n        <p>1、强调<span class=\"hl-blue\">儿童应处于学校教育的中心</span>。认为儿童具有内在的能力，能自发地学习。</p>\n        <p>2、<span class=\"hl-blue\">重视学校</span>的社会功能。强调学校应成为理想的家庭、完善的社会和民主政治的雏形。</p>\n        <p>3、<span class=\"hl-blue\">学校课程与实际生活相联系</span>。这样不仅可以唤起儿童学习的意愿，而且能摒弃无意义的形式训练。并把各门学科统一起来，获得整体知识。</p>\n        <p>4、强调<span class=\"hl-blue\">培养儿童的自我探索和创造</span>精神。帕克认为教师的作用是指导学生发现真理，使学生养成习惯来使用真理。</p>\n        <p>三、<span class=\"bg-red-pill\">评价</span>: <span class=\"handwritten-purple\">(调动儿童积极，忽视系统学习)</span></p>\n        <p>1、昆西教学法有利于<span class=\"hl-purple\">调动儿童</span>学习的积极性和主动性，满足学生的兴趣与需要，使儿童成为学习的主人</p>\n        <p>2、昆西教学法过分强调儿童的个性，忽视教师的作用，<span class=\"hl-purple\">忽略了系统知识的学习</span>，导致教学质量降低</p>\n\n        <!-- Block 3 -->\n        <p class=\"block-title\">昆西教学法 <span class=\"handwritten-red\">(考过名词解释) 口诀：含泪评价 (<span class=\"circle-red\">含</span>义、<span class=\"circle-red\">内</span>容、<span class=\"circle-red\">评</span><span class=\"circle-red\">价</span>)</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"bg-red-pill\">含义</span>: 昆西教学法由美国进步主义教育家帕克创办的一种教学方法。</p>\n        <p><span class=\"bg-red-pill\">内容</span>: 强调<span class=\"hl-blue\">儿童应处于学校教育的中心</span>；<span class=\"hl-blue\">重视学校</span>的社会功能，强调学校应成为理想的家庭、完善的社会和民主政治的雏形；<span class=\"hl-blue\">学校课程与实际生活相联系</span>；强调<span class=\"hl-blue\">培养儿童的自我探索和创造</span>精神 <span class=\"handwritten-blue\">(儿童中心重学校，学实联系培创造)</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"bg-red-pill\">评价</span>: 昆西教学法有利于<span class=\"hl-purple\">调动儿童</span>学习的积极性和主动性，但过分强调儿童的个性，<span class=\"hl-purple\">忽略了系统知识的学习</span>，导致教学质量降低 <span class=\"handwritten-purple\">&lt;调动儿童积极，忽视系统学习&gt;</span></p>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
